<ul>
<li>I was advised to change my formatting and arrangement from the last time I posted this. I think it looks better having all of the updates in one place, rather than having update texts in the procedures, description, <em>and</em> afterwards.</li>
<li>The Foundation has many animals with human-level or above intelligence in containment, and the tenrecs hadn't even hit a 10 on the scale by the time the breach happened (which they didn't even cause!) The only reason there's a problem at all is because the wild population got affected.</li>
<li>Short answer? I suck at dialogue.</li>
<li>Long answer? I <em>really</em> suck at dialogue. I had an interview at first, actually, but it ended up being a cliche, stilted mess of Cierra basically being &quot;oh my god there's voices in my head&quot; and asking questions or knowing things she shouldn't be able to guess. I'd say being essentially possessed involuntarily by an anomalous force can't be good for your psyche, though.</li>
</ul>
<p>I do plan on expanding on the relation between her and the tenrecs in a later work, though.</p>

