<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>This SCP mentions a blackboxed anomaly that requires monitoring in Madagascar. I propose crosslinking to <a href="/scp-1585">SCP-1585</a>, because due to SCP-1585's effects Madagascar would have to be monitored.</p>
<p>Editing this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Reports from Foundation zoologists stationed in Madagascar while monitoring SCP-████ indicated</p>
</blockquote>
<p>To this:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Reports from Foundation zoologists stationed in Madagascar while monitoring <a href="/scp-1585">SCP-1585</a> indicated</p>
</blockquote>
