			<div class="content" id="post-content-3817128">
									

<p>Something similar (unblackboxing a blackboxed SCP number) was proposed a while back somewhere else. I'll say what I said there: it sets a dangerous precedent, if this occurs. Why stop at un black-boxing SCP numbers? Why not Site numbers? Researcher names? Maybe this five-letter blackboxed researcher is actually Dr. Gears?</p>
